are world forever.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Live an extraordinary adventure and <strong>meet mysterious friends and foes</strong> throughout your journey in Scaredom's mystical universe.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore <strong>huge, fantastic open-worlds</strong> filled with quests and secrets awaiting to be discovered.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock <strong>brutal bonus levels</strong>, for the bravest of nightmares</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745810/extras/793e35cf065f9c8292c0f64892aaabb7.poster.avif?t=1664285912\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745810/extras/793e35cf065f9c8292c0f64892aaabb7.webm?t=1664285912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745810/extras/793e35cf065f9c8292c0f64892aaabb7.mp4?t=1664285912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745810/extras/8dd56dd2c1b88a63624689015dfe566b.avif?t=1664285912\" /></div><br>Meet the inhabitants of Scaredom's Universe throughout your adventure. Some will give you quests and wonderful rewards ! But beware, in Scaredom's bizarre worlds, not everyone is a friend...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745810/extras/703fd26b904bb7a38fd642f9df3c7d6c.poster.avif?t=1664285912\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745810/extras/703fd26b904bb7a38fd642f9df3c7d6c.webm?t=1664285912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745810/extras/703fd26b904bb7a38fd642f9